 "about": "Latest developments: the scan that picks items for nodo's files. scripts/press-feeds.mjs reads `feeds` every day on GitHub; the Mon/Thu cloud task adds web search on top and passes items through scripts/press-merge.mjs. `files` is \"all\" (every priority file in v1/files.json) or a list of file ids; `aliases` adds search terms the files' data does not give; `exclude` drops look-alikes. Institutional items that do not change a stage are published without review, press items wait on review/press (scripts/autonomy.mjs, classifyPress). Every feed must be on nodo's source list (v1/sources.json): press-feeds.mjs skips any feed that is not, and the validator flags it.",
